<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 04:35:39 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>10月中国游戏市场收入300亿元同比减少4.27%：手游下滑2.2%，PC下滑15%</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606588</link><description>伽马数据报告显示 10 月中国游戏市场实际销售收入 300 亿元、同比下降 4.27%，其中手游下滑 2.2%、PC 端下滑 15%。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:20:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bbca242b56331ed890aaaf6f593b6c33b511d943</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606588">GameLook</source></item><item><title>用 Unreal Engine 把 Anyma 的 Coachella 演出扩展为广播 AR</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine</link><description>Anyma 的 Coachella 现场借助 Unreal Engine、MetaHuman 与广播 AR 技术，把音乐视觉体验带给了线上观众。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">337da5318251a6bfe1b582440f1fa57277a240c1</guid><source url="https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine">Unreal Engine 博客</source></item><item><title>新一波单人 AI 游戏制作者赚到钱了吗？并没有</title><link>https://mobilegamer.biz/are-the-new-wave-of-solo-ai-game-makers-making-any-money-no-not-really</link><description>用 Claude Code 等 AI 工具做的游戏正涌入应用商店，但真正赚到钱或获得下载量的寥寥无几，单人 AI 开发的变现现实远比热度冷清。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:19:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e17dc5b4c9c27b40eaf0fe5ec13cc3beff8d9cd5</guid><source url="https://mobilegamer.biz/are-the-new-wave-of-solo-ai-game-makers-making-any-money-no-not-really">MobileGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>gta4-reversed：用 C++20 运行时重实现 GTA IV，进度突破 1%</title><link>https://dev.to/master4824/gta4-reversed-starting-a-c20-runtime-reimplementation-of-gta-iv-1070-crossing-1-e5</