nk>https://80.lv/articles/keep-unreal-engine-5-projects-clean-with-this-optimization-toolkit</link><description>Leartes Studios 的编辑器扩展能给项目健康度打分、找出闲置资产并梳理依赖关系，帮 UE5 开发者把项目里的杂物清出去。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3ce9d8e2ac71fd8d4ee2e710010b525e54322835</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/keep-unreal-engine-5-projects-clean-with-this-optimization-toolkit">80 Level</source></item><item><title>独游开发者吐槽：“发行商想要55%收入，还不保证营销费” ，同行：来收租呢？</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606580</link><description>五名芬兰学生开发的弹球 Roguelike 收到的首份发行报价要拿走 55% 收入且不保证营销投入，引发同行对发行分成是否合理的讨论。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:07:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">42e79b06e54b907242eccd909cd5629c2eb2bd69</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606580">GameLook</source></item><item><title>Newzoo：GTA 6 预购者多为典型主机玩家且以男性为主，游戏将“扩大市场而非简单再分配”</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/newzoo-gta-6-pre-orders-are-archetypal-console-players-but-overwhelmingly-male-game-will-grow-the-market-rather-than-simply-redistribute-it</link><description>Newzoo 的数据显示，GTA 6 预购者多是高消费的典型主机玩家且以男性为主，这款游戏更可能把整个市场做大，而非只在现有玩家之间重新分配。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6df1c951d5f0d9f46be95b1cbd34404f05a8cd5e</guid><source url="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/newzoo-gta-6-pre-orders-are-archetypal-console-players-but-overwhelmingly-male-game-will-grow-the-market-rather-than-simply-redistribute-it">GamesIndustry.biz</source></item><item><title>泄露《GTA 6》的黑客承认入侵 Rockstar Games</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/hacker-behind-gta-6-leak-pleads-guilty-to-rockstar-games-breach</link><description>Lapsus$ 成员此前被裁定不适合受审，如今承认了导致《GTA 6》早期画面与源代码外泄的那次入侵。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:43:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1c396a1e76a3b52414b81c7ab08797785676fe23</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/hacker-behind-gta-6-leak-pleads-guilty-to-rockstar-games-breach">80 Level</source></item><item><title>探索音频驱动的面部表演，让 NPC 长对话更生动</title><link>https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/2298677-exploring-audio-driven-facial-performance-for-longer-npc-dialogue</link><description>长对话带来两个制作难题：如何生成可信的面部表演、又如何让表演在整场戏里保持一致，本文探讨用音频驱动的方案来解决。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 11:31:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5b5cd8a0689dbe288e4d61c0012a82c51c5906eb</guid><source url="https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/2298677-exploring-audio-driven-facial-performance-for-longer-npc-dialogue">GameDev.net</source></item><item><title>开源图像工作台 TexForge 发布：为游戏美术与批量处理而生</title><link>https://dev.to/nan_nan_d86f644d31091c00f/texforge-is-out-a-open-source-image-workbench-for-games-and-batch-work-3e66</link><description>一款 MIT 协议的跨平台桌面工具，把法线贴图、通道打包、Mipmap 链与批量处理等 113 个图像操作收进一个工作台，覆盖 Unity、Unreal、Godot 等引擎的美术管线。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:16:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e92695680c30baac1334940ad3057439da383600</guid><source url="https://dev.to/nan_nan_d86f644d31091c00f/texforge-is-out-a-open-source-image-workbench-for-games-and-batch-work-3e66">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>你的精灵图集校验器可能在查 JSON 解析器已经改过的数据</title><link>https://dev.to/framesprite-team/your-sprite-atlas-validator-may-be-checking-data-the-json-parser-already-changed-32om</link><description>图集 PNG 和元数据都能正常打开解析，不代表交付无歧义，问题藏在 JSON 原文与校验器拿到的数据之间。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:05:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">cc369f4da507a4a8f9234f62c9dd991e4e3b589a</guid><source url="https://dev.to/framesprite-team/your-sprite-atlas-validator-may-be-checking-data-the-json-parser-already-changed-32om">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>报告：韩国手游下载量跌 28%，收入仍接近 50 亿美元</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/report-south-koreas-mobile-game-downloads-fall-28-as-revenue-holds-near-5bn</link><description>Sensor Tower 新报告显示韩国手游下载量五年间从 5.4 亿跌至 3.9 亿，但内购收入依然坚挺，手游市场正从拼下载转向拼留存与付费。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:27:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0cc00c4fd56d1c2effae902cdb52c29e6b7870ba</guid><source url="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/report-south-koreas-mobile-game-downloads-fall-28-as-revenue-holds-near-5bn">PocketGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>两款放置类网页游戏的前 60 秒教会了我们什么（附真实数据）</title><link>https://dev.to/makerio/what-the-first-60-seconds-of-two-idle-browser-games-taught-us-with-real-numbers-3l5h</link><description>用两款 1.6MB 纯 JS 放置小游戏的真实数据，拆解开局 60 秒的留存关键，给做网页放置游戏的开发者一份实测参考。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:45:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">53d75852d958671fceceeea203229f1a2919eac9</guid><source url="https://dev.to/makerio/what-the-first-60-seconds-of-two-idle-browser-games-taught-us-with-real-numbers-3l5h">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>冲刺里的 Unreal Insights：站会前就能做完的一次短性能排查</title><link>https://dev.to/juegotech/unreal-insights-in-the-sprint-a-short-performance-pass-you-can-finish-before-standup-i3b</link><description>教你在站会前用 Unreal Insights 快速过一遍性能瓶颈，把 profiling 变成日常习惯，而不是等到卡顿了才救火。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:44:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">4271449ec28848a95b5bd76410f76d09c25170da</guid><source url="https://dev.to/juegotech/unreal-insights-in-the-sprint-a-short-performance-pass-you-can-finish-before-standup-i3b">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>VR 手势追踪还是手柄？如何选择</title><link>https://dev.to/aplusgamesstudio/hand-tracking-vs-controllers-in-vr-how-to-choose-4nkd</link><description>需要精准操作、按键和触觉反馈的动作类 VR 游戏选手柄，追求易上手和沉浸感的培训、休闲与演示场景更适合手势追踪。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">cc0afd93ff7f3c1153d516b0706479b611b0d403</guid><source url="https://dev.to/aplusgamesstudio/hand-tracking-vs-controllers-in-vr-how-to-choose-4nkd">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>让年长玩家十秒上手的浏览器游戏：经典作品做对了什么</title><link>https://dev.to/liza_18827c15bdd387c4cd9c/designing-a-browser-game-older-players-can-start-in-ten-seconds-what-the-classics-get-right-cco</link><description>经典纸牌、棋盘与益智游戏无需教程、不惩罚慢反应、允许悔棋，这些设计选择任何浏览器游戏都可以借鉴。</description><pubDat